		{
			dependencies: ["19C32F0E30411935"]
			description: [
				"筛选是获取资源和了解可产物品的绝佳入门方式，甚至到了游戏后期依然适用！你需要注意的主要限制是通过此方法能获得的资源&o&#D2691E范围&r&r。"
				""
				"  While capable of producing most         vanilla &#D2691Egems&r, &#D2691Eores&r and &#D2691Eother              resources&r, even some from other        mods. You can only get so much from    crushing and sifting stone and basalt   by-products. However, for what it &o&#D2691Eis&r&r     capable of producing, the stone block  approach works great and can see      you through for as long as you need   as well as most needs in a general       sense."
			]
